* CABSRT09 - ACCOUNT EXTRACT SORT FOR THE BILL TRIGGER
* MVT OS/360 SORT/MERGE FORM OF JCL/CTLCARDS/CABSRT09.
* SORTS TELCABS.CABS.ACCOUNT.RAW BY BAN SO THAT CABBIL01 CAN
* READ IT SEQUENTIALLY AND SO THAT THE TRIGGER FILE IT WRITES IS
* ALSO IN BAN ORDER - CABBIL02 BINARY SEARCHES THAT FILE AND
* WOULD GIVE WRONG ANSWERS ON AN UNSORTED ONE.
*
* THE RULE THAT LEFT THIS CARD
*   THE INCLUDE CONDITION ON THE STATUS BYTE AT 60 IS NOT CODED
*   HERE.  THIS SORT HAS NO INCLUDE STATEMENT.  THE E15 EXIT
*   CABSXACC NOW DROPS EVERY ACCOUNT WHOSE STATUS BYTE IS C.
*   CLOSED ACCOUNTS THEREFORE NEVER REACH CABBIL01 AT ALL AND ARE
*   NOT COUNTED IN ITS SKIP REASON S2.  THE PROGRAM STILL CARRIES
*   THE S2 TEST AND STILL PRINTS THE COUNTER, WHICH IS WHY THAT
*   COUNTER HAS READ ZERO EVERY NIGHT SINCE 1996.
*
* OPTION EQUALS IS NOT CODED - THIS SORT HAS NO OPTION
* STATEMENT.  BAN IS UNIQUE ON THE ACCOUNT FILE SO NO TWO
* RECORDS CARRY THE SAME KEY AND THE ORDER OF EQUAL KEYS DOES
* NOT ARISE.
*
* WHICH ACCOUNTS ARE SELECTED IS NO LONGER READABLE FROM THIS
* CONTROL CARD.
 SORT FIELDS=(1,13,CH,A)
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=(200)
 MODS E15=(CABSXACC,4096,SORTEXIT,N)
 END
